AB  - The article suggests to investigate the utility of a global multicomponent metric, and to establish conversion relationships to address critical gap in sport-science methodology. It proposes potential solutions to develop more accurate conversion methods and standardized reporting practices such as the session rating of perceived exertion (sRPE) method, using an analogy approach with three primary determinants, and quantifying energy expenditure across training modalities.
