AB  - Cycling club memberships start from as little as £25 per year, and some even come with the added benefit of discounts at local cafes, bike shops, and British Cycling membership. 1 HOLD YOUR SELF TO A GOAL You shouldn't need an excuse to head out on your bike, but it can sometimes feel like a struggle at this time of year, with the temperatures remaining low after a long winter. - Rahul Dass, 43, Bristol 21 SHIFT INTO S&C MAINTENANCE As your on-bike training load increases, it's important to modify strength and conditioning work off the bike to prevent fatigue that could negatively impact high-intensity sessions. British Cycling's website has useful resources and video guides focused on improving bike-handling, while most cycle coaches and clubs offer advice and drills as part of technique-based sessions. Extracted from the article
