AB  - This survey includes 74 stimuli of different types of training load for athletes in the second phase of the preparatory period. In this phase of the preparatory period, the applied plan and programme are supposed to improve the results of a certain number of middle-distance athletes on 1500 m. The plan and programme of the training are organized according to the degree of development of a certain number of athletes with the objective to reach top results on 1500 m. Goran Ukić was one of them. All the athletes mostly held to the planned training and the best results were achieved by Goran Ukić. Since the examinees are not top athletes but only active athletes, there was significant improvement of results in competition period and therefore it can be said that the applied plan and programme of training in the second phase of the preparatory period had a particular effect of improving the athletes' results. ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR
