AB  - The article presents the significance of lactate threshold on endurance running. It defines lactate threshold and describes the means of measuring lactate using blood samples and changes in ventilation and respiratory gas samples. It discusses four types of lactate threshold workouts and suggests coaching tips on how to increase an athlete's training load without running faster. A sample lactate threshold training program is also presented.
