AB  - On the basis of the dynamics of the decline in the spectral power of high-frequency component during exercise, which is parameter of vagal activity, calculation algorithm of the vagal threshold (TVA) has been designed. The value of the TVA is relatively very stable and varies in healthy persons regardless of age and sex to the extent between 40% and 50% of the maximal heart rate reserve. Exercise testing and modified calculation of TVA allows for patients with significantly reduced activity of the autonomic nervous system (e.g. within early phase of rehabilitation after acute myocardial infarction) to set a "safe" limit of exercise rehabilitation. ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR
