AB  - The article discusses a research study on strategies to monitor and mange chronic fatigue in baseball players. Topics highlighted include the impact of chronic fatigue on players' capabilities to sustain their force and power throughout the season, field-based fatigue monitoring, throwing velocity, running times, pitch count, session rating of perceived exertion, and perceived recovery status.
