AB  - This study examined the training ideology and practices of Chinese advantage track and field events in different periods, and explored the event characteristics, training ideology, training cycles, means of training, and training loads, by the methods ol literature review, questionnaire investigation and comparative analysis. Conclusions; 1) Learning from the advanced training theory and experience, re understanding the event characteristics, breaking through the traditional constraints, forming a scientific training concept, focusing on the special needs, innovating and optimizing the training means and loading, and forming a unique technical style, are the main reasons for the phase advantage of China's high jump, throw, hurdles and other events. 2) The main reasons for the decline of high jump performance in China are that the training idea of rapid run-up has not been well reflected in athletes' training for many years; athletes lack the long-term plan, not pay enough attention to the training methods, technical details, personal characteristics and load process control; and there is no new breakthrough for the training of the high level athletes. 3) There is a clear gap of China's elite female throwers' release speed in recent years compared with that in 1990s; China's elite female throwers have lost the characteristics of fast movement and fast release, their lower limbs' flexibility and explosive force are not enough, and their basic skills are not solid, and they cannot effectively transform the greatest strength into specific speed, which have affected their performance. 4) The huge contrast and failure of the middle and long distance running events shows that we have not formed a stable and advanced theory and idea on endurance events, we change the training still only on method, means, load, blindly use large amount of load and high intensity, and lack of profound theory of sports biology; it also shows that the management and training system for high-level athletes and sports teams is not perfect enough. 5) We should change the view on cycle and training load, form the training idea of small amount, high intensity and training by competition; guide the training with the concept of the coordinated force of nervous system and muscle, understand the characteristics of the event deeply, and strengthen the specific training with the speed as the core, to form the leading technical advantage, and to promote the development of the merfs hurdle project in China. Liu Xiang's retirement from injury and not good Chinese athletic performance indicate that the training load, competition rules and process control of lop athletes are still not accurate, and the scientific training monitoring and development system of our high-level athletes needs further strengthening. 6) In practice, the new training theory and concept are not well understood, and cannot be systematically embodied in young people's training, which greatly affects the further development of our country's dominant projects. ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR
