AB  - The article discusses a study which investigates the relationship of oxygen consumption rate kinetics on the aerobic training status of a trained to elite level athletes. The study determined the maximal oxygen uptake, work-rate associated to maximal oxygen uptake and oxygen uptake kinetics of moderate and maximal exercise of 55 subjects. The study concluded that the oxygen uptake kinetics is improved as the fitness level of athlete is increased from low to intermediate.
