AB  - The article offers strategy for the management and implementation of aerobic training variables according to the guidelines of the American College of Sports Medicine (ACSM). It focuses on the training recommendations for maximal aerobic power or volume oxygen (VO2max) and energy expenditure (EE) depending on the body mass index (BMI). An overview of the comparison between ACSM guidelines and the actual management for cardiorespiratory training is provided.
