AB  - Zhang Jian's blood and urine indexes were determined during the training session. The results showed that after training the urine index did not change remarkably, so did the indexes of blood lactate and blood urea, which reflected that his training load and intensity were not great. During the training session Zhang Jian's parameters of hemoglobin and red blood cells were within the ideal limits, showing that he was in good condition. And his training loads and intensity were reasonable, because they were arranged according to the energy supply characteristics of the ultra-long distance swimming. The changes of blood glucose after training reflected that Zhang Jian's nutrition supply scheme was reasonable and feasible, which has laid a solid foundation for establishing his future scientific nutrition supply scheme when he cross over the Bohai Straits.
