AB  - The article discusses a study about the relationship between vagal withdrawal and reactivation indices and aerobic capacity or maximal running velocity in taekwondo athletes. The study calculated heart rate variability (HRV) parameters at one-minute intervals and determined vagal reactivation indices based on HR recovery. Results revealed the association of vagal reactivation indices with one another and with aerobic capacity. Observation showed the sensitivity of vagal reactivation to exercise training and to changes in training workload.
