AB  - This paper attempts to explain the core of specific events of competitive sport and training ideas from the overall attributes and system functions of competitive sports performance, by the methods of literature review and expert interview. Conclusions; The core pf specific events should he the specific core ability to lead and decide competitive level; this study analyzes I he specific core ability of sub event group based on the theory of event group; taking track and field events as examples, this study analyzes the specific core ability, points out that the core competence ol sprint is specific quality, reaction and the economy of action, the core competence of race walking and middle and long-distance race is specific quality, technique economy and cardiorespiratory endurance, that of jumping event is specific qualih ability, technique coordination and limelv explosive force, that of throwing event is the optimization and combination of the kinetic chain and prepared explosive force; we should consider competitive needs, combine specific characteristics, get the function area of specific kinetic chain, optimize training methods, reasonably arrange training load, and combine specific quality with specific skills, nervous system and mental control. We hope to provide references for competitive training. ABSTRACT FROM AUTHOR
