AB  - A documentation for training load was kept, and calculation were conducted over the six-month preparatory period (i.e. 98 training units) for a female athlete specializing in a medium range distance runs. Two ways of collecting data were applied: - by training journals, - by sports tester PE-3000. Training means were analyzed in the following ways: - by training journals, - by X-710 computer programme, - and by diagrams for the frequency of myocardial contractions according to modifications introduced by authors. It was concluded, that the method of measurement of training work capacity structure strongly influence differentiation of research results, what in turn leads to the far reaching practical consequences.
