AB  - The change of functional state of the swimmers was observed for 14 months by determining physiological and biochemical indexes, such as morning pulse, proteinuria, urine with blood occult, hemoglobin, testosterone and body fat. Combined with their subjective sensitivity of fatigue the relationship between fatigue and their training loads was understood. When the runners felt more fatigued the nutriment Sanqing Renshenjing Capsules were administrated to observe their state of functional recovery. It was found that when the runners subjectively felt more fatigued, their morning pulse would be 4 more than the normal value. There would occur protein and blood occult in their morning urine. The trends of the change of hemoglobin, body fat and testosterone were basically similar. The changes of hemoglobin and testosterone were generally consistent with the subjective sensitivity of fatigue and exercise performance, but sometimes they were inconsistent. When the body is fatigued, the administration of Sanqing Renshenjing Capsules has remarkable effects on the functional recovery of the runners.
