AB  - After comparison and analysis of all the speed skating results at the III Asian Winter Games it was found that there existed no obvious gap between Chinese skaters and the best skaters of Asia in sprint events, but there does exist a big gap between them in long distance events. The reason could be involved in training load, training for absolute speed, tactical and psychological training as well as coaches' professional qualities. It is suggested to adjust the pre-competition training arrangement and to improve the way of selecting skaters for the national team.
