AB  - The aim of this study was to substantiate the strategy of training loadings at the final year of the Olympic cycle in elite hurdlers training. The data of training loading in 110 m hurdle runners at two last years of the Olympic cycle (n=15) had been analysed. It had been revealed that the optimization of special hurdle runner's training at the final year of the Olympic cycle demands the maximal coming nearer the characteristics of the main competitional distance and in sprint running on the distance parts of various length. The number of training lessons must be the same as at previous year or it can be decreased a little.
