AB  - The paper presents result of studies on training load applied in selected endurance sports (middle- and long-distance running, road cycling, and speed skating) analyzed as regards their similarity to competition practice and in respect of the improved energy mechanisms. The information about this last ones were supplied by Sport-Tester PE-3000 and processed due a special computer program. In summary, the material shows characteristic trends in training load of the individual sports and age groups.
