AB  - By means of rowing the possibility of an individual biomechanical control of athletes during an entire competition and practice-period is described regarding both performance and technique development. However, without the physiological measuring items of lactate and pulse under different training load such methods would be incomplete. The direct visualization of power graphs allows a systematical control and makes it possible to relearn already falsely practised techniques in a rowing basin owing to feedback.
